                                                "sense_id": "354fb787-29fa-3e60-932b-64edd5534c78",
                                                "text": "About them all there is that sort of stiff quaint unreality, that conjunction of the grotesque, and even of a certain bourgeois snugness, with passionate contortion and horror, that is so characteristic of Gothic art."
